            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ndaviti amwĩa Avisai, Ndũkamwanange; nũndũ nũũ ũtonya kũtambũũkĩsya mwĩtĩkĩw’a mauta wa Yeova kw’oko kwake, na akethĩwa ate ĩvĩtyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
