        },
        {
          "text": "Yeova ndakandeke nĩtambũũkĩsye mwĩtĩkĩw’a mauta wa Yeova kw’oko kwakwa: ĩndĩ yu, nĩngũkwĩsũva, osa ĩtumo yĩla yĩ mũtwenĩ wake, na sũva wa manzĩ, na tũkĩthi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
