          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova akatũngĩa kĩla mũndũ ũlũngalu wake na kĩthito kyake; nũndũ Yeova nũkũnenganie kw’okonĩ kwakwa ũmũnthĩ, na ndinetĩkĩla kũtambũũkĩsya mwĩtĩkĩw’a mauta wa Yeova kw’oko kwakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
